    """`__re_nhom_cuoi(Match) -> string`: ten cua nhom DAT TEN khop sau
    cung, hoac "" neu khong co.

    Duyet TU CUOI ve dau (nhu Python), bo qua nhom khong khop va nhom
    chi mang ten SO (nhom khong dat ten) - `Group.Name` cua chung la
    "1", "2"... nen thu ky tu dau co phai chu so."""
    G = "class " + re_ns() + "Group"
    ra("  .method public static string __re_nhom_cuoi(" + M + " m) cil managed")
